          "hideComponent": "false",
          "topMargin": "10",
          "jcr:created": "Mon May 22 2023 19:31:20 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">NasoPore bioresorbable nasal dressing</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<p>NasoPore nasal dressing is a 100% synthetic polymer and serves as a reliable stent for 36 to 48 hours<sup>1</sup> after placement. By keeping its integrity for those critical hours, NasoPore can help minimize postoperative complications and bleeding.<sup>2</sup></p>\n<p>NasoPore comes in a wide variety of options- fast degrading, standard, firm and extra firm- to allow you to provide the best option for your patient's needs.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 11 2024 18:01:58 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
