          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">HemoPore bioreabsorbable nasal dressing</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<p>HemoPore nasal dressing is a synthetic polymer blended with chitosan lactate designed to deliver tissue support and hemostatic control.<sup>3</sup><br>\n</p>\n",
