          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">OtoPore bioresorbable ear dressing</span></span><br>\n</p>\n<p>OtoPore ear dressing is a synthetic polymer and serves as a reliable stent for 36 to 48 hours<sup>4</sup> after placement. By keeping its integrity for those critical hours, OtoPore can help minimize postoperative complications and bleeding.<sup>5</sup></p>\n<p>OtoPore comes in a wide variety of options-cylinder standard, cylinder firm and square firm - to allow you to provide the best option for your patient's needs.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Jun 11 2024 18:10:13 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
